# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms), submitted straight from the browser.
#
# Web3Forms access keys are PUBLIC by design — this one is inlined into the
# client bundle, so it is not a secret. The free plan only accepts submissions
# from the browser, which is why we call the API client-side rather than via a
# server route. Get a free key at https://web3forms.com by entering the inbox
# you want enquiries to land in.
#
# Set the SAME value in Vercel under Settings > Environment Variables, for
# every environment. Because it is a NEXT_PUBLIC_ var it is read at build time.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your_access_key_here
